{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>超人氣寫真偶像高野真央今年春夏憑著甜美臉蛋與傲人上圍迅速竄紅，她在7月底正式推出生涯首本實體個人寫真集，書名藏著紀念已故祖父的深意，情感與話題性兼具，想知道該寫真藏著哪些火辣福利嗎？快跟著小編共同一飽眼福吧！</p><p>性感肉彈出道即爆紅</p><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157339452972994560516348.jpeg/oHBqOqPYHDheH2XZwsmDdk2lBucYKvTGV_VM71f1TO8\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><p>更多高野真央的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157343311829143552913654.jpeg/cSj_OxRgGIDR65QRNmfqW6KKxxTrlq0jaisPsWorD7E\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram＠mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157348564771278848546178.jpeg/s1uJEKTcXP5Saub4_FvuieJekqayvrh1P-puqj_qbqo\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram＠mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157343314152919040574201.jpeg/WLjnNARKjQYd2CfRVSEKd2Jk6Plc1gsNSIb4WEiG-Fg\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157343316476694528540139.jpeg/CQI3Wm5F25JB26kpKQChEzYXl_PZgYbY-zXsS_s17Es\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157343318800470016963207.jpeg/yazZynW4gxmKyubuIicQYqSGO-ks0yELDIcIaAyHCGg\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157343321090691072871960.jpeg/Yrio0DAVE9UjaHgnwkT4-5VF4FFPHfrRKfAm5CnwJuQ\"/><figcaption>高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高野真央（Instagram@mao_takano_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/115734331409826